tle":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Marduk","label":"Marduk","target_id":"huntik:page:4648","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Marduk","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4648"},{"target_title":"The Professor","label":"The Professor","target_id":"huntik:page:2053","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Professor","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2053"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Wilder","label":"Wilder","target_id":"huntik:page:4467","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Wilder","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4467"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Sceptre Deception]]\"","value_text":"\"The Sceptre Deception\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Sceptre Deception","label":"The Sceptre Deception","target_id":"huntik:page:4692","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Sceptre_Deception","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4692"}]}],"start":0,"end":289}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"[[Sophie Casterwill]] used Doublespell [[Raypulse]] outside the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]] to knock back two of Klaus' [[Suits#Klaus's_Suits|Suits]]. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}\n\nDuring his battle with Sophie Casterwill, [[The Professor]] used Doublespell [[Rippleburst]] through one hand to defeat Sabriel for good, resulting in her Amulet being destroyed. {{source|The Mission}}\n\nOne of Kiel's [[Casterwill Hunters]] used Doublespell Augerfrost on the roof of [[the Cloisters]] during a battle with the Huntik team. {{Source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"Sophie Casterwill used Doublespell Raypulse outside the Tomb of Nefertiti to knock back two of Klaus' Suits. [The Sceptre Deception]\n\nDuring his battle with Sophie Casterwill, The Professor used Doublespell Rippleburst through one hand to defeat Sabriel for good, resulting in her Amulet being destroyed. [The Mission]\n\nOne of Kiel's Casterwill Hunters used Doublespell Augerfrost on the roof of the Cloisters during a battle with the Huntik team. [The Casterwill Connection]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"<gallery orientation=\"landscape\" position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nFile:S2E29 Sophie Doublespell Augerfrost.jpg|Doublespell: [[Augerfrost]]\nFile:S2E32 Doublespell Boltflare.jpg|Doublespell: [[Boltflare]]\nFile:S2E52 Dante Doublespell Dragonfist.png|Doublespell: [[Dragonfist]]\nFile:S2E32 Doublespell Kindlestrike.jpg|Doublespell: [[Kindlestrike]]\nFile:S1E15 Sophie Doublespell Raypulse.jpeg|Doublespell: [[Raypulse]]\nFile:S2E52 Lucas Sandra Shadowlock.png|Doublespell: [[Shadowlock]]\nFile:S2E52 Dante doublespell stoneglove.png|Doublespell: [[Stoneglove]] \n</gallery>","text":"File:S2E29 Sophie Doublespell Augerfrost.jpg|Doublespell: Augerfrost\nFile:S2E32 Doublespell Boltflare.jpg|Doublespell: Boltflare\nFile:S2E52 Dante Doublespell Dragonfist.png|Doublespell: Dragonfist\nFile:S2E32 Doublespell Kindlestrike.jpg|Doublespell: Kindlestrike\nFile:S1E15 Sophie Doublespell Raypulse.jpeg|Doublespell: Raypulse\nFile:S2E52 Lucas Sandra Shadowlock.png|Doublespell: Shadowlock\nFile:S2E52 Dante doublespell stoneglove.png|Doublespell: Stoneglove"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Double-sort\n|DUT = Dubbelspreuk|POR=Duplo-feitiço}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Utility spells]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Doublespell is a multiplication spell that allows Seekers to cast another spell twice. It typically results in the spell being projected with both hands instead of one, but it can also be channelled through one hand to make the spell twice as powerful.\n\n== History ==\nSophie Casterwill used Doublespell Raypulse outside the Tomb of Nefertiti to knock back two of Klaus' Suits. [The Sceptre Deception]\n\nDuring his battle with Sophie Casterwill, The Professor used Doublespell Rippleburst through one hand to defeat Sabriel for good, resulting in her Amulet being destroyed. [The Mission]\n\nOne of Kiel's Casterwill Hunters used Doublespell Augerfrost on the roof of the Cloisters during a battle with the Huntik team. [The Casterwill Connection]\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nFile:S2E29 Sophie Doublespell Augerfrost.jpg|Doublespell: Augerfrost\nFile:S2E32 Doublespell Boltflare.jpg|Doublespell: Boltflare\nFile:S2E52 Dante Doublespell Dragonfist.png|Doublespell: Dragonfist\nFile:S2E32 Doublespell Kindlestrike.jpg|Doublespell: Kindlestrike\nFile:S1E15 Sophie Doublespell Raypulse.jpeg|Doublespell: Raypulse\nFile:S2E52 Lucas Sandra Shadowlock.png|Doublespell: Shadowlock\nFile:S2E52 Dante doublespell stoneglove.png|Doublespell: Stoneglove \n\n== International Names ==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S2E32 Doublespell Boltflare.jpg\n| class = Utility\n| users =  [[The Betrayer]] <br>[[Casterwill Hunters]]<br> [[Dante Vale]] <br> [[Kiel]] <br> [[Marduk]] <br>[[The Professor]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br>[[Wilder]]\n| first = \"[[The Sceptre Deception]]\"\n}}'''Doublespell''' is a multiplication spell that allows [[Seekers]] to cast another spell twice. It typically results in the spell being projected with both hands instead of one, but it can also be channelled through one hand to make the spell twice as powerful.\n\n== History ==\n[[Sophie Casterwill]] used Doublespell [[Raypulse]] outside the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]] to knock back two of Klaus' [[Suits#Klaus's_Suits|Suits]]. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}\n\nDuring his battle with Sophie Casterwill, [[The Professor]] used Doublespell [[Rippleburst]] through one hand to defeat Sabriel for good, resulting in her Amulet being destroyed. {{source|The Mission}}\n\nOne of Kiel's [[Casterwill Hunters]] used Doublespell Augerfrost on the roof of [[the Cloisters]] during a battle with the Huntik team. {{Source|The Casterwill Connection}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n== Gallery ==\n<gallery orientation=\"landscape\" position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nFile:S2E29 Sophie Doublespell Augerfrost.jpg|Doublespell: [[Augerfrost]]\nFile:S2E32 Doublespell Boltflare.jpg|Doublespell: [[Boltflare]]\nFile:S2E52 Dante Doublespell Dragonfist.png|Doublespell: [[Dragonfist]]\nFile:S2E32 Doublespell Kindlestrike.jpg|Doublespell: [[Kindlestrike]]\nFile:S1E15 Sophie Doublespell Raypulse.jpeg|Doublespell: [[Raypulse]]\nFile:S2E52 Lucas Sandra Shadowlock.png|Doublespell: [[Shadowlock]]\nFile:S2E52 Dante doublespell stoneglove.png|Doublespell: [[Stoneglove]] \n</gallery>\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Double-sort\n|DUT = Dubbelspreuk|POR=Duplo-feitiço}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Utility spells]]","categories":["Magic","Utility spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Betrayer","label":"The Betrayer","target_id":"huntik:page:4562","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Betrayer","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4562"},{"target_title":"Casterwill Hunters","label":"Casterwill Hunters","target_id":"huntik:page:9603","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_Hunters","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A9603"},{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Marduk","label":"Marduk","target_id":"huntik:page:4648","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Marduk","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik